<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last updated: September 2026</p>
 
<p>This Privacy Policy explains what information this Discord bot (the "Bot") collects and how it is used.</p>
 
<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>The Bot stores the following data for each user who interacts with its commands:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Discord user ID</li>
  <li>Virtual currency balance and transaction history within the Bot</li>
  <li>Inventory of items purchased through the Bot's shop</li>
</ul>
<p>The Bot does not collect message content, personal contact information, or any data beyond what is needed for its economy features.</p>
 
<h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
<p>Stored data is used solely to operate the Bot's features, such as tracking balances, cooldowns, and leaderboards within the servers where the Bot is added.</p>
 
<h2>3. Data Storage</h2>
<p>Data is stored locally by the Bot's operator and is not sold or shared with third parties.</p>
 
<h2>4. Data Removal</h2>
<p>If you would like your data removed, contact the Bot's operator via the support contact listed on the Bot's Discord application page.</p>
 
<h2>5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the Bot after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
 
